{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55239","headline":"诗 · 程逊","name":"诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽室有时闻鴈叫，空庭无路见蟾光。\n（见《册府元龟》卷九五一《总录·咎徴》二。\n）（〖1〗《册府元龟》：「程逊爲太[常]〖尝〗卿奉使吴越，仲秋之夕，阴暝如晦。\n逊尝爲诗曰〖略〗。\n同僚见之，讶其诗语稍异。\n及使回，遭风水而溺焉。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"程逊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}